{"id":1424981,"title":"Sungradsk RP Cars 90's (Update Content-Pack for IV/MTS \"Grozard RP Cars 90's\" By BDFM Team V1.0)","summary":"The Sungradsk RP Cars 90s isn't just an update to the Immersive Vehicles mod's content pack, called the Grozard RP Cars 90s. It's essentially a new content pack, replacing the old version. A detailed description is available in the content pack's jar file.","description":"\u003cp\u003eHave you been waiting for an update to the Grozard RP Cars 90s content pack? And finally, here it is: the first release update! We'd even say it's\u003cbr\u003enot just an update, but a practically new content pack for the Immersive Vehicles mod, renamed \"Sungradsk RP Cars 90s.\" The content pack update and the\u003cbr\u003epack itself were created by a small teenage Creative Association called BDFM Team (an abbreviation for BlitzART (formerly Grozard), Dez, Fairek\u003cbr\u003e(formerly Whicked Gus), melonvanika), the founder of this content pack himself, Alexander BlitzART. This update features reworked 3D models of the Daewoo Lanos,\u003cbr\u003eBMW E46, and Volkswagen Passat B5. Textures have been updated for the Mercedes-Benz W124 and Volkswagen Golf MK4. New vehicles have been added,\u003cbr\u003eincluding the Skoda Octavia A4, three versions of the Volkswagen Transporter T4, three BMW E36 models, the E38 750I, and the E39, and the Lexus RX 300.\u003cbr\u003eAnimation bugs have been fixed, and missing icons have been eliminated. Additionally, door panels can be installed on the Lanos, the rear seats can be\u003cbr\u003efolded down to expand the trunk on the Lexus, and the steering wheel can be removed on the Lexus, Transporter T4, Golf MK4, and BMW E46. Most of the\u003cbr\u003e3D engine models were borrowed from the internet, but as modeling progresses, custom engine models will be added in future updates.\u003cbr\u003eThe Content Pack was supposed to be released on January 1st, but due primarily to the blackout in Ukraine and the lack of thorough error\u003cbr\u003echecking of the completed content pack, the update was postponed to January 8th!\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ciframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3S6OQr4HZzc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","game":"minecraft","type":"Mods","urls":{"curseforge":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sungradsk-rp-cars-90s-update-content-pack-for-iv","project":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sungradsk-rp-cars-90s-update-content-pack-for-iv"},"thumbnail":"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1603/936/256/256/639035980192602432.png","created_at":"2026-01-10T11:10:17.727Z","downloads":{"monthly":0,"total":47966},"license":"","donate":"","categories":["Addons","Player Transport"],"members":[{"title":"Owner","username":"blitzart_and_bdfm_team","id":119926476}],"links":[],"files":[{"id":7550363,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sungradsk-rp-cars-90s-update-content-pack-for-iv/files/7550363","display":"Sungradsk RP Cars 90's V1.0.2 1.18.2-1.20.1","name":"Sungradsk RP Cars 90's [Release V1.0.2 for 1.18.2-1.20.1].jar","type":"release","version":"1.20.1","filesize":669519133,"versions":["Client","1.20.1","Forge","1.18.2","1.19.2","Server"],"downloads":7958,"uploaded_at":"2026-01-30T12:25:32.71Z"},{"id":7550271,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sungradsk-rp-cars-90s-update-content-pack-for-iv/files/7550271","display":"Sungradsk RP Cars 90's V1.0.2 1.16.5","name":"Sungradsk RP Cars 90's [Release V1.0.2 for 1.16.5].jar","type":"release","version":"1.16.5","filesize":669138547,"versions":["Client","1.16.5","Forge","Server"],"downloads":3,"uploaded_at":"2026-01-30T12:05:55.663Z"},{"id":7550190,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sungradsk-rp-cars-90s-update-content-pack-for-iv/files/7550190","display":"Sungradsk RP Cars 